  "details": "(I’m aware this post technically already exists, https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/per-user-avatar-audio-slider, but I don’t want to necro an almost 3 year old post while still bringing it back up to attention.)\n\nIt would be really nice to have a per-user avatar volume slider, like how we have with user volume, because I enjoy many avatars having cool audio (mine included) so I don’t want to just straight up turn it off, but I also don’t want to block the noisy user’s avatar (I want to see people and their avatars as much as possible to keep immersion and expressionism.)",
